# FlowForge — environment variable template.
# Copy to .env.local and fill real values:  cp .env.example .env.local
# Real .env* files are git-ignored and agent-blocked; only this template is tracked.
# Never put real secrets here. MCP OAuth tokens (Atlassian/Figma/Context7) are managed
# by Claude Code itself and do NOT belong in any .env file.

# Public base URL of the site — used for canonical URLs and Open Graph metadata
# (Metadata API metadataBase). Example: https://flowforge.example.com
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=
